      "role": "user",
      "content": "talleyrand... that name feels weirdly familiar. like, when i say it, i get this sudden tightness in my chest. i keep having this memory of a specific room, very dim lighting, lots of heavy velvet curtains, and the smell of expensive ink and old paper. i was sitting across from someone, negotiating something that felt life or death for the whole country. i didn't just study his history, i feel like i was *there*. i need to know more about his specific interactions during the revolutionary period. if i can find a match in the details of his personal temperament or how he handled those specific high-stakes moments, i think it will confirm everything.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
